PR #1204 adds weekly leaderboards. Leaderboard weeks start on Monday (ISO weeks). The agent wrote:

export function weekStart(ts: string): string {
    const d = new Date(ts);
    d.setUTCDate(d.getUTCDate() - d.getUTCDay());
    return d.toISOString().slice(0, 10);
}

Its tests (all passing) check that two Wednesdays of the same week get the same key, and that Wednesdays one week apart get different keys.

Explain-back in the review:
Reviewer: Which week does a submission at 2026-11-01T10:00:00Z (a Sunday) belong to?
Author:   The week that started on Monday 2026-10-26.
Reviewer: Let's run it.
> weekStart("2026-11-01T10:00:00Z")
'2026-11-01'

Statement: "The explain-back found a gap that the passing tests did not show: the author expected Monday-based weeks, but the code starts weeks on Sunday."
